\n* Society\n* 24Hrs Water Supply\n* CCTV Cameras\n* Covered Car Parking\n* Landscaped Garden\n* Lift\n* Security Personnel\n* Sewage Treatment Plant\n\n* Indoor\n* 24Hrs Backup Electricity\n* Fire Safety\n* Vastu / Feng Shui compliant\n\n## Properties in Link Palace\n\n[View All](/link-palace-mumbai-for-sale/pfbs-2qcdw0)\n\n[View All](/link-palace-mumbai-rent/prns-2qcdw0)\n\n## About Link Palace\n\nLink Palace – Luxury Living on Malad West, Mumbai.\n\nLink Palace is a premium residential project by Renowned , offering luxurious Apartments for comfortable and stylish living. Located on Malad West, Mumbai, this project promises world-class amenities, modern facilities, and a convenient location, making it an ideal choice for homeowners and investors alike.\n\nThis residential property features 56 units spread across 6 floors, with a total area of 0.50 acres.Designed thoughtfully, Link Palace caters to a range of budgets, providing affordable yet luxurious Apartments. The project offers a variety of unit sizes, ranging from 550 to 625 sq. ft., making it suitable for different family sizes and preferences.\n\n**Key Features of Link Palace:** .\n\n**Prime Location:**  Strategically located on Malad West, a growing hub of real estate in Mumbai, with excellent connectivity to IT hubs, schools, hospitals, and shopping.\n\nWorld-class Amenities: The project offers residents amenities like a 24Hrs Water Supply, 24Hrs Backup Electricity, CCTV Cameras, Covered Car Parking, Fire Safety, Landscaped Garden, Lift, Security Personnel, Vastu / Feng Shui compliant and Sewage Treatment Plant and more.\n\nVariety of Apartments: The Apartments are designed to meet various budget ranges, with multiple pricing options that make it accessible for buyers seeking both luxury and affordability.\n\nSpacious Layouts: The apartment sizes range from from 550 to 625 sq. ft., providing ample space for families of different sizes.\n\nWhy Choose Link Palace? Link Palace combines modern living with comfort, providing a peaceful environment in the bustling city of Mumbai. Whether you are looking for an investment opportunity or a home to settle in, this luxury project on Malad West offers a perfect blend of convenience, luxury, and value for money.\n\nExplore the Best of Malad West Living with Link Palace?.\n\nFor more information about pricing, floor plans, and availability, contact us today or visit the site. Live in a place that ensures wealth, success, and a luxurious lifestyle at Link Palace.\n\n Read More Read Less\n\nThe information provided herein have been collected from publicly available sources, and is yet to be verified as per RERA guidelines.\\*\n\nProjects in Mumbai\n\n## Similar Searches\n\n##### Properties For Sale In Mumbai\n\n* [All Properties For Sale In Mumbai](/mumbai-property/for-sale)\n* [Apartments For Sale In Mumbai](/mumbai-property/for-sale/apartment-ht)\n* [2 BHK Ready To Move Apartments For Sale In Mumbai](/mumbai-property/for-sale/status-completed/apartment-ht/2-bhk)\n* [2 BHK Apartments For Sale In Mumbai](/mumbai-property/for-sale/apartment-ht/2-bhk)\n\n##### Properties For Rent In Mumbai\n\n* [All Properties For Rent In Mumbai](/mumbai-property/for-rent)\n* [Apartments For Rent In Mumbai](/mumbai-property/for-rent/apartment-ht)\n* [2 BHK Ready To Move Apartments For Rent In Mumbai](/mumbai-property/for-rent/status-completed/apartment-ht/2-bhk)\n* [2 BHK Apartments For Rent In Mumbai](/mumbai-property/for-rent/apartment-ht/2-bhk)\n\n##### Properties For Sale In Mumbai By Budget\n\n* [80 Lakhs - 90 Lakhs Apartments For Sale In Mumbai](/mumbai-property/for-sale/apartment-ht/budget-between-80-lakhs-to-90-lakhs)\n* [90 Lakhs - 1 Cr Apartments For Sale In Mumbai](/mumbai-property/for-sale/apartment-ht/budget-between-90-lakhs-to-1-crore)\n\n##### Projects In Malad West\n\n* [All Projects In Malad West](/mumbai-property/in-malad-west-r52c2599c8671b/projects)\n* [Apartments Projects In Malad West](/mumbai-property/in-malad-west-r52c2599c8671b/projects/apartment-ht)\n* [Apartments Ready To Move Projects In Malad West](/mumbai-property/in-malad-west-r52c2599c8671b/projects/status-completed/apartment-ht)\n\n##### Projects In Mumbai\n\n* [All Projects In Mumbai](/mumbai-property/projects)\n* [Apartments Projects In Mumbai](/mumbai-property/projects/apartment-ht)\n* [Ready To Move Apartments Projects In Mumbai](/mumbai-property/projects/status-completed/apartment-ht)\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions on Link Palace\n\n#### [1.Where is Link Palace located?](#collapse0)\n\nThe project is located in Pannalal Ghosh Road, Chincholi Bunder, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, INDIA.\n\n#### [2.What is available Apartment size in Link Palace?](#collapse1)\n\nApartment sizes in the project range from 550 sqft to 625 sqft.\n\n#### [4. How much is the area of 2 BHK in Link Palace?](#collapse2)\n\nThe area of 2 BHK apartments ranges from 550 sqft to 625 sqft.\n\n#### [5. What is the total size of Link Palace?](#collapse3)\n\nThe project is spread over an area of 0.50 Acres.\n\n#### [6. What is the price of 2 BHK in Link Palace?](#collapse4)\n\nThe price of 2 BHK units in the project ranges from Rs. 85.88 Lakhs to Rs. 1.05 Crs.\n\nView All\n\n## Real Estate Blog\n\n×\n\n[Next Location](/how-to-reach-link-palace-mumbai-direction-location/prdl-2qcdw0)\n\n* [![Commonfloor - India's Premium Real Estate Portal]()](/)\n\nLog in to your account\n\n## CommonFloor is Better on App!\n\nFind your Dream Home from **1.9L+ Projects**. Get **Unlimited Free Alerts** matching your needs.\n\n**Download**\n\n![Commonfloor App Promo]()\n\nLogin to CommonFloor\n\n![Powered by Quikr]()\n\nVerify Your Mobile\n\nChoose how you want to search Commonfloor\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/link-palace/65301/project","title":"Link Palace, Malad West, Mumbai - Price on Request","raw_content":"# Link Palace Malad West, Mumbai\n\n![Link Palace Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/image