t Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Link Palace.\n\nA total of 1 residential transactions has been registered so far for Link Palace, amounting to ₹ 90 L till September 2026.\n\nRent in Link Palace ranges from ₹ 32 K to ₹ 40 K with options available for 1 BHK.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Link Palace moved from ₹ 23,300/sqft to ₹ 23,700/sqft, reflecting a 1.72% rise.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Link Palace moved from ₹ 22,800/sqft to ₹ 23,300/sqft, reflecting a 2.19% rise.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Link Palace From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 17.7 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | ₹ 90 L | ₹ 17,700 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Link Palace Floor Plans\n\n### 2 BHK 565 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Saleable)\n\nPrice: **Price on Request**\n\n### 2 BHK 550 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Saleable)\n\nPrice: **Price on Request**\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in Link Palace\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in Link Palace, Mumbai.\n\n![1 BHK Apartment For Sale in Link Palace in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Vijay Sharma  profile picture]()\n![1 BHK Apartment For Rent in Link Palace in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Vijay Sharma  profile picture]()\n![1 BHK Apartment For Rent in Link Palace in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![BHUSHAN RAMDAS SAWANT  profile picture]()\n![Bhushan Ramdas Sawant]()\n\nShree Sadguru Properties\n\n![Vijay Sharma]()\n\nV.s.estates\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Link Palace\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Link Palace to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Link Palace Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/